      "description": "Find pages in a Notion database, with optional filters and sorting. For the tasks due today, tomorrow or overdue, give the date column and the day instead of writing a filter, and leave out the finished ones with the column that holds their status. Each page also gives the email addresses of the people in its People columns (people_emails.Owner), to message each owner.",
